  "notes": "USAGE:\n{観戦|かんせん} is specifically for watching competitive events (sports, battles, matches). For watching performances like concerts or movies, use {鑑賞|かんしょう} or {観賞|かんしょう} instead. Do not confuse with the homophone {感染|かんせん} (infection).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {観戦|かんせん}する: to watch a game/match\n- {観戦|かんせん}に{行|い}く: to go watch a game\n- {生|なま}{観戦|かんせん}: watching live (in person)\n- {観戦|かんせん}チケット: spectator ticket\n- {観戦|かんせん}{記|き}: game/match report",
